- Replace the placeholder values (SOLDIER_NAME, TARGET_TYPE) with actual values

**CRITICAL**: Do NOT provide vague instructions like "Use PVP COMBAT TEMPLATE" - you must include the ACTUAL JAVASCRIPT CODE from the template in the tactics array so the AI code generator receives complete working code.

