## TACTICAL PATTERNS

**Pincer Attack** (2 soldiers):
- Soldier 1 (Tank): Engages immediately from front
- Soldier 2 (Flanker): Waits 1.5 seconds, then attacks SAME target from opposite side
- Both use appropriate template (PVP for players, COMPLETE for mobs)
- Both target same entity

**Boss Fight** (3 soldiers):
- Soldier 1 (Tank): No delay, frontal assault
- Soldier 2 (DPS): 1 second delay, left flank
- Soldier 3 (DPS): 2 second delay, right flank
- All attack SAME target

